<title>JAPAN: Matsushita says to soon announce BSkyB investment.</title>
<headline>Matsushita says to soon announce BSkyB investment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd said on Tuesday it would soon make an announcement on its capital investment plans in British Sky Broadcasting Group Plc, or BSkyB.</p>
</text>
